00:13:26.257 --> 00:13:28.620
"Obviously, if you are
physically unable to travel

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:31.680
to an office or have a
critical personal obligation

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.360
then your absence is understandable."

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:35.670
Now, Musk has the right to
require employees to work

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:38.340
in the office if it
doesn't violate other laws.

