without running a foul

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.850
of the Americans with Disabilities Act

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.320
and other laws prohibiting discrimination

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:44.700
against people with disabilities.

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.230
He'll also have to follow the FMLA

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:48.750
and other laws that protect an
employee's right to take time

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:51.630
off if they're sick or caring
for an ill family member.

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:52.530
Now, generally, companies

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:55.470
of these sizes have HR
departments to handle these kinds

00:13:55.470 --> 00:13:59.160
of requests and obligations,
but sure, Elon is

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:01.230
going to personally make
